From b74933d9a14fc294fecbdfe4aba4dcd1ccfa2b73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Weidong Sun <sunweidong@linux.alibaba.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:11:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] alibabacloud: locate guest disks by cloud disk ID

Match Alibaba disk IDs against kernel serial/WWID information for virtio
and NVMe devices. Require a unique match and retain the existing guest
device-discovery retries without falling back to device ordering.

Co-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
